<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Thursday were 100,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000, USDA reported. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady with the midsession Thursday.</p>
